{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531063-experimentation-with-the-dark-creatures","id":1531063,"title":"Experimentation with the Dark Creatures.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-02-18T10:56:55-08:00","id":1531063,"title":"Experimentation with the Dark Creatures.","content":"So, in the world of CofD there is potentially room to have almost anything, this situation would even be a possibility so I was wondering if anyone has any idea how this would happen, making it clear that I know about the conspiracies on Deviant, but the catch here is a little different, not based on the victims who would be the deviants, but on the experiment in whether and how it affects the world, be it the ordinary or the supernatural one. Basically what I want to know is what would happen if they decided to experiment with the creatures of darkness. In particular three points.<br /> <br /> 1. The reasons: There can be several, curiosity, experimentation, use as a weapon, money or in the case of a hunter to have more resources on how to kill their targets. I've already covered the basics, but I wanted to know if anyone know how to develop this better.<br /> <br /> 2. The experiments themselves. More specifically, what would they be doing with them, would they make strange fusions, try to replicate the abilities, intensify the anomalies, correct the &quot;flaws&quot; or leave them under control? Quite simple actually, but it has an infinite number of possibilities and we can also assume that they made mistakes along the way.<br /> <br /> 3. The repercussion of this in the world, this can be divided into two parts, which would be from the point of view of mortals and from the point of view of supernaturals, at least the latter would be uneasy, whether in a region or globally depending on the group and the experiment time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T14:11:51-08:00","id":1531072,"title":"","content":"Setting aside Deviant, see The Cheiron Group from Hunter, the Deva Corporation from Demon, Last Dynasty International from Mummy, Amalgama Ltd from Promethean (as well as several other alchemists), RD-13 and whoever created the Mimics from Werewolf (see Night Horrors: Shunned by the Moon), and similar groups elsewhere in the line.<br /> <br /> The playbook is largely the same as in Deviant as far as the breadth of answers to the questions you're asking, with the caveat that monsters who aren't deviants tend to have organization and/or a level of volatility that precludes the level of exploitation the Devoted tend to get entangled with at a consistent level. If an organization gets what it's looking for out of its experimentation, it will tend to keep its results under wraps to better make use of them, or else blow its cover in some major gesture that leaves its scars on the public consciousness until it self-destructs/draws the wrong kind of attention/runs out of steam/et cetera and the populace can get on with forgetting the details and going back to their daily lives, if it doesn't wipe the location off the map instead.<br /> <br /> If anyone finds out about it and survives, it's likely to end up as grist for the rumor mill either way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-18T18:40:34-08:00","id":1531079,"title":"","content":"Thinking about it, the closest thing you can get to &quot;experimenting&quot; on mages is the Annunkai, Abyssal demi-gods hollowing out mages... Well I meant that and I'm sure ethe Ordo Dracul would happily experiment on a Mage if they got a chance...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T00:03:17-08:00","id":1531095,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531063-experimentation-with-the-dark-creatures?p=1531079#post1531079\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thinking about it, the closest thing you can get to &quot;experimenting&quot; on mages is the Annunkai, Abyssal demi-gods hollowing out mages... Well I meant that and I'm sure ethe Ordo Dracul would happily experiment on a Mage if they got a chance...</div> </div> </div> </div>What about the Tremere Liches beginnings?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T04:06:46-08:00","id":1531100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Baaldam</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531063-experimentation-with-the-dark-creatures?p=1531095#post1531095\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What about the Tremere Liches beginnings?</div> </div> </div> </div>Was that extreme soul shaping?<br /> <br /> The creation of legacies, and the existence of Deviants (shredded souls) suggests souls can be used as a multitool of magical effects, if you can just figure out how to configure them correctly...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27248-orathaic","name":"orathaic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27248_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1032"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T04:55:42-08:00","id":1531103,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531063-experimentation-with-the-dark-creatures?p=1531100#post1531100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Was that extreme soul shaping?</div> </div> </div> </div>Unintentional, but definitely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-19T15:40:57-08:00","id":1531146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>orathaic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1531063-experimentation-with-the-dark-creatures?p=1531100#post1531100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The creation of legacies, and the existence of Deviants (shredded souls) suggests souls can be used as a multitool of magical effects, if you can just figure out how to configure them correctly...</div> </div> </div> </div>Though the Divergence is infamously unpredictable, with centuries of history of conspiracies experimenting and refining their approach to Divergence trying to exert more control over the result. Sometimes following the process has a lot to do with the deviant that comes out Remade. Sometimes it has very little to do with the end result.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}